OL,3,GNEWSAMan who shot acquaintance guilty
OL,4,Aof murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of murder
OL,7,Fafter shooting an acquaintance with a
OL,8,Fdouble-barrelled shotgun in Nottingham.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to a property in Ryeland
OL,12,FGardens, in The Meadows, at about 05:30
OL,13,FGMT on 28 February, when Jack Preston
OL,14,Fclaimed a masked man had burst into his
OL,15,Fhome and shot Coel Tainton.
OL,17,FTainton, 24, whose family previously
OL,18,Fsaid had a "precious soul and
OL,19,Fcontagious laugh", died soon after
OL,20,Fdespite treatment by paramedics.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
