OL,3,GNEWSAMan who shot acquaintance guilty
OL,4,Aof murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreston, 34, of Ryeland Gardens, later
OL,7,Ftold police he had acted in
OL,8,Fself-defence but he was found guilty of
OL,9,Fmurder by a jury at Nottingham Crown
OL,10,FCourt on Thursday. He will be sentenced
OL,11,Fon 24 September.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
